# Non-secret config for the 'dev' environment. Committed to the repo.
# Credentials (APP_USERNAME / APP_PASSWORD / API_TOKEN) must NOT go here:
#   - CI: GitHub → Settings → Environments → dev → Environment secrets
#   - Local: env/.env.<env>.local or env/.env.local (git-ignored)
